{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Mounts with a flying aura fly only in Outland, or in Northrend with Cold Weather Flying",
  "contract": [
    "Ash'adar, Harbinger of Dusk 917000 carries a 100% ground aura and a 280% mounted flight aura without the",
    "flying-area attribute, so the client spell alone lets it fly anywhere.",
    "Players fly with Expert riding or better in Outland, and in Northrend once they know Cold Weather Flying 54197.",
    "CoA.MaxRidingFromStart grants 54197 at login, so the rider unlearns it before the Northrend checks.",
    "Stormwind and the rest of Azeroth allow no flying at any riding skill, and a rider who leaves Outland stops",
    "flying.",
    "Socketless sessions never acknowledge flight, so the test counts the server's SMSG_MOVE_SET_CAN_FLY and",
    "SMSG_MOVE_UNSET_CAN_FLY packets, not client flight or rendered tooltips."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 120000,
